5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Hi everyone! I want us all to get along, so let's find a fair way. I'll look into the Ward complaint log for this point and the Statements at the residents' meeting.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is so lovely to see us all gathered here. I want us to find a solution that keeps our hearts light. I will look into the supervised mornings on the next lane and the visit to the station block's bin house.,"{""words"":42,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I agree that fairness is key. To understand the actual burden of maintenance, I will look into the Ward filing requirements per the installations clerk and the station block's meeting minutes.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to make sure it's fair for everyone's front door! I'll look into the measurements of the five frontages and the ward complaint log for this point.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to be with you all. To ensure our solution is sustainable for every pocket, I shall look into the block ledger of refuse-point expenses and the ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,Does anyone else think we should check the truck arrival times? I'm worried about how early people have to wake up. Maybe someone can swap one of their choices?,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"That is a very thoughtful point, Kenji. I wouldn't want anyone to feel rushed or stressed in the morning. I can certainly swap my look into the next lane's mornings for the truck arrival time.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Kenji, checking the arrival time is logical. However, since Shizue has already offered to swap, there is no need for further changes. We should proceed with these selections to gather the necessary data.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,I think it's great that Shizue-san is helping! I'm still going to check the frontages and the complaint log because I want to know who has been sad about the bins!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,It is heartwarming to see such cooperation and care for one another. Let us proceed with these choices; the truth often reveals itself when we look with an open heart and a clear mind.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm glad we're all on the same page! I'll stick with the complaint log and the residents' meeting statements. I hope we can find a way to make everyone smile again.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I shall stick with the truck arrival time and the visit to the station block's bin house. I hope we can find a way to keep our street pleasant for everyone.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will maintain my choices: the Ward filing requirements and the station block's meeting minutes. It is important to understand the administrative burden and the long-term conflicts associated with permanent structures.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'll stick with my choices too! I'm going to check the measurements of the five frontages and the ward complaint log. I want to see if the space is actually fair for everyone!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,I shall remain with my selections: the block ledger of refuse-point expenses and the ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs. Understanding the financial flow is the first step toward a lasting peace.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Kenji,,Alright! We have our list. I'm excited to see what we find out. Let's all do our best to get the right information so we can make a decision that makes everyone happy!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"I agree, Kenji. Let us all look into these things with kindness and patience. I look forward to hearing what you all discover so we can find a gentle way forward together.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"Since we have finalized our selections, I will now proceed to gather the data. I look forward to analyzing the results logically to ensure we avoid any unsustainable arrangements.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,Rin,,Me too! I'm going to go find out everything right now! I hope the measurements show that we can all share the space properly!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,1,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,1,4,talk,Servas,,"Indeed. Let us each seek the knowledge we need. I shall return with a clear view of the costs, so we may build a future that is light on the purse and heavy on harmony.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
