70,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"It truly warms my heart to see us all in such agreement. By choosing to share the burden together, we are choosing kindness and understanding. I am very happy.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
71,3,2,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
72,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"The consensus is clear. By eliminating the options with high administrative, financial, and social costs, we have arrived at the most sustainable conclusion. I am satisfied with this result.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
